{"id":"nezachem","lemma":"незачем","pos":"adv","rank":2754,"glosses":["there is no need (to), there is no use (to)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ec/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%B0%D1%87%D0%B5%D0%BC.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%B0%D1%87%D0%B5%D0%BC.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Больше ждать незачем.","en":"There's no need to wait any longer.","words":[{"g":"any more"},{"g":"to wait for"},null]},{"text":"Тебе незачем бояться.","en":"You have no reason to be afraid.","words":[{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},null,{"g":"to fear, to be afraid"}]},{"text":"Тебе незачем это делать.","en":"You don't need to do that.","words":[{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},null,{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to make, to do"}]},{"text":"Мне незачем врать тебе.","en":"I have no reason to lie to you.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,{"g":"to lie"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"}]},{"text":"Беспокоиться было незачем.","en":"There was no need for concern.","words":[{"g":"to worry"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null]}]}